#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:7
msgid ""
"Mattermost Mission Collaboration for Microsoft extends Microsoft for "
"mission-critical coordination, command and control, incident response, "
"and DevSecOps workflows in demanding environments, including air-gapped "
"and classified networks by embedding Mattermost inside Teams. Use data-"
"sovereign tools like secure chat, Playbooks, and Calls directly within "
"M365, Teams, and Outlook."
msgstr "Mattermost Mission Collaboration for Microsoft는 Teams 내부에 OKR.BEST를 임베드하여, 에어갭 및 기밀 네트워크를 포함한 까다로운 환경에서 미션 크리티컬한 조율, 지휘 통제, 인시던트 대응, DevSecOps 워크플로를 위해 Microsoft를 확장합니다. M365, Teams, Outlook 내에서 보안 채팅, 플레이북, 통화 같은 데이터 주권 도구를 직접 사용하세요."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:9
msgid ""
"This app is designed to work with Microsoft 365, Teams, and Outlook and "
"is currently in :ref:`Beta <administration-guide/manage/feature-"
"labels:beta>`. From Mattermost v10.7.1, this integration supports Entra "
"ID-based Single Sign-On (SSO) for automatic authentication. Users must "
"exist in both Mattermost and Microsoft with matching email addresses; the"
" integration handles authentication but does not automatically provision "
"new users. See the :doc:`user provisioning </administration-"
"guide/manage/admin/user-provisioning>` product documentation for details "
"on setting up SSO."
msgstr "이 앱은 Microsoft 365, Teams, Outlook와 함께 작동하도록 설계되었으며 현재 :ref:`베타 <administration-guide/manage/feature-labels:beta>` 상태입니다. OKR.BEST v10.7.1부터 이 통합은 자동 인증을 위한 Entra ID 기반 SSO(Single Sign-On)를 지원합니다. 사용자는 OKR.BEST와 Microsoft 양쪽에 일치하는 이메일 주소로 존재해야 하며, 통합은 인증을 처리하지만 새 사용자를 자동으로 프로비저닝하지는 않습니다. SSO 설정에 대한 자세한 내용은 :doc:`사용자 프로비저닝 </administration-guide/manage/admin/user-provisioning>` 제품 문서를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:11
msgid "Mattermost embedded as a Microsoft Teams app."
msgstr "Microsoft Teams 앱으로 임베드된 OKR.BEST입니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:15
msgid "Deploy"
msgstr "배포"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:17
msgid ""
"Before starting the setup, review this section to familiarize yourself "
"with the 3 components needed to integrate Mattermost with M365, including"
" `Azure App registration <#register-an-ms-teams-app-in-azure>`__, "
"`Microsoft Teams App installation <#mattermost-plugin-setup>`__, and "
"`Mattermost plugin configuration <#install-mattermost-in-microsoft-"
"teams>`__. Each component plays a crucial role in ensuring seamless "
"communication and collaboration between Mattermost and Microsoft 365 "
"services. Then complete the following integration setup steps in the "
"order listed below."
msgstr "설정을 시작하기 전에, 이 섹션을 검토하여 OKR.BEST를 M365와 통합하는 데 필요한 3가지 구성 요소(`Azure 앱 등록 <#register-an-ms-teams-app-in-azure>`__, `Microsoft Teams 앱 설치 <#mattermost-plugin-setup>`__, `OKR.BEST 플러그인 구성 <#install-mattermost-in-microsoft-teams>`__)를 숙지하세요. 각 구성 요소는 OKR.BEST와 Microsoft 365 서비스 간의 매끄러운 커뮤니케이션과 협업을 보장하는 데 중요한 역할을 합니다. 그런 다음 아래 나열된 순서대로 다음 통합 설정 단계를 완료하세요."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:20
msgid "Register an MS Teams app in Azure"
msgstr "Azure에서 MS Teams 앱 등록"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:22
msgid ""
"An application must be registered in Microsoft Azure to enable secure "
"authentication and authorization between Mattermost and M365 services. "
"This app registration acts as the bridge for permissions and "
"connectivity. The **Azure App** is responsible for authentication and "
"managing permissions."
msgstr "OKR.BEST와 M365 서비스 간의 안전한 인증 및 권한 부여를 활성화하려면 Microsoft Azure에 애플리케이션을 등록해야 합니다. 이 앱 등록은 권한과 연결의 다리 역할을 합니다. **Azure App**\\ 은 인증과 권한 관리를 담당합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:24
msgid ""
"Sign in to the `Azure portal <https://portal.azure.com/>`_ using an admin"
" Azure account."
msgstr "관리자 Azure 계정으로 `Azure 포털 <https://portal.azure.com/>`_\\ 에 로그인합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:26
msgid "Go to your **Azure Portal > Microsoft Entra ID**."
msgstr "**Azure Portal > Microsoft Entra ID**\\ 로 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:28
msgid ""
"Create a new app registration by selecting the **Add application "
"registration** \"Quick Action\":"
msgstr "**Add application registration** \"Quick Action\"을 선택하여 새 앱 등록을 생성합니다:"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:32
msgid "Give it a name."
msgstr "이름을 지정합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:33
msgid ""
"Choose the \"Accounts in this organizational directory only (single "
"tenant)\" option."
msgstr "\"Accounts in this organizational directory only (single tenant)\" 옵션을 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:34
msgid "Leave the Redirect URI empty."
msgstr "Redirect URI는 비워 둡니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:38
msgid ""
"Go to your newly created application and copy the **Application (client) "
"ID** and **Directory (tenant) ID** values. You'll need those later to "
"configure the plugin."
msgstr "새로 생성한 애플리케이션으로 이동하여 **Application (client) ID**\\ 와 **Directory (tenant) ID** 값을 복사합니다. 나중에 플러그인을 구성하는 데 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:40
msgid ""
"Go to your newly created application and copy the Application (client) ID"
" and Directory (tenant) ID values. You'll need those later to configure "
"the plugin."
msgstr "새로 생성한 애플리케이션으로 이동하여 Application (client) ID와 Directory (tenant) ID 값을 복사합니다. 나중에 플러그인을 구성하는 데 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:43
msgid ""
"Go to **Certificates and secrets** to generate a new client secret. Make "
"a copy of the secret value, as it will only be shown once. You'll need "
"this value to configure the plugin."
msgstr "**Certificates and secrets**\\ 로 이동하여 새 클라이언트 시크릿을 생성합니다. 시크릿 값은 한 번만 표시되므로 사본을 만들어 두세요. 플러그인을 구성하는 데 이 값이 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:45
msgid ""
"Go to Certificates and secrets to generate a new client secret. Make a "
"copy of the secret value, as it will only be shown once. You'll need this"
" value to configure the plugin."
msgstr "Certificates and secrets로 이동하여 새 클라이언트 시크릿을 생성합니다. 시크릿 값은 한 번만 표시되므로 사본을 만들어 두세요. 플러그인을 구성하는 데 이 값이 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:48
msgid "Go to **API Permissions** to complete the following steps:"
msgstr "**API Permissions**\\ 로 이동하여 다음 단계를 완료합니다:"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:50
msgid ""
"Ensure the ``User.Read`` **delegated** permission is added. See the "
"`Microsoft SSO documentation <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/microsoftteams/platform/tabs/how-to/authentication/tab-sso-register-"
"aad#enable-sso-in-microsoft-entra-id>`_ for details."
msgstr "``User.Read`` **delegated** 권한이 추가되어 있는지 확인합니다. 자세한 내용은 `Microsoft SSO 문서 <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoftteams/platform/tabs/how-to/authentication/tab-sso-register-aad#enable-sso-in-microsoft-entra-id>`_\\ 를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:51
msgid ""
"Add the **Microsoft Graph API** ``TeamsActivity.Send`` **application** "
"permission for notifications. See the `Microsoft notifications "
"documentation <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/teams-send-"
"activityfeednotifications?tabs=desktop%2Chttp>`_ for details."
msgstr "알림을 위해 **Microsoft Graph API** ``TeamsActivity.Send`` **application** 권한을 추가합니다. 자세한 내용은 `Microsoft 알림 문서 <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/teams-send-activityfeednotifications?tabs=desktop%2Chttp>`_\\ 를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:52
msgid ""
"Add the **Microsoft Graph API** ``AppCatalog.Read.All`` **application** "
"permission for notifications. See the `Microsoft List teamsApp "
"documentation <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/api/appcatalogs-"
"list-teamsapps?view=graph-rest-1.0&tabs=http>`_ for details."
msgstr "알림을 위해 **Microsoft Graph API** ``AppCatalog.Read.All`` **application** 권한을 추가합니다. 자세한 내용은 `Microsoft List teamsApp 문서 <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/api/appcatalogs-list-teamsapps?view=graph-rest-1.0&tabs=http>`_\\ 를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:53
msgid ""
"Grant admin consent for the default directory to prevent users from "
