#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:90
msgid "Configure the Mattermost plugin"
msgstr "OKR.BEST 플러그인 구성"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:92
msgid ""
"A Microsoft Teams app is installed into Microsoft Teams. This app "
"facilitates collaboration between Mattermost and Teams, providing a tab "
"containing Mattermost within the Teams client. The **Teams App** is "
"installed within Microsoft Teams to enable collaboration via a tab."
msgstr "Microsoft Teams 앱이 Microsoft Teams에 설치됩니다. 이 앱은 OKR.BEST와 Teams 간의 협업을 지원하며, Teams 클라이언트 내에 OKR.BEST를 포함하는 탭을 제공합니다. **Teams App**\\ 은 탭을 통한 협업을 활성화하기 위해 Microsoft Teams 내에 설치됩니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:94
msgid ""
"Download the `latest release of the plugin <https://github.com/mattermost"
"/mattermost-plugin-msteams-devsecops/releases>`_."
msgstr "`최신 플러그인 릴리스 <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-msteams-devsecops/releases>`_\\ 를 다운로드합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:96
msgid ""
"Go to **System Console > Plugins > Plugin Management > Upload Plugin**, "
"and upload the plugin binary you downloaded in the previous step."
msgstr "**관리자 도구 > 플러그인 > 플러그인 관리 > 플러그인 업로드**\\ 로 이동하여 이전 단계에서 다운로드한 플러그인 바이너리를 업로드합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:98
msgid ""
"Go to **System Console > Plugins > Plugin Management**. In the "
"**Installed Plugins** section, scroll to **Mattermost Mission "
"Collaboration for Microsoft**."
msgstr "**관리자 도구 > 플러그인 > 플러그인 관리**\\ 로 이동합니다. **Installed Plugins** 섹션에서 **Mattermost Mission Collaboration for Microsoft**\\ 까지 스크롤합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:100
msgid "Enter an **Application Version**. You can start with ``1.0.0``."
msgstr "**Application Version**\\ 을 입력합니다. ``1.0.0``\\ 으로 시작할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:102
msgid ""
"Generate an Application ID in `version 4 UUID format "
"<https://www.uuidgenerator.net/>`_ and enter it in the **Application ID**"
" field."
msgstr "`버전 4 UUID 형식 <https://www.uuidgenerator.net/>`_\\ 으로 Application ID를 생성하여 **Application ID** 필드에 입력합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:104
msgid ""
"Enter the values you noted earlier in the appropriate fields, including "
"**Directory (tenant) ID**, **Application (client) ID**, and **Client "
"Secret**."
msgstr "앞서 기록한 값을 **Directory (tenant) ID**, **Application (client) ID**, **Client Secret**\\ 을 포함한 적절한 필드에 입력합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:106
msgid ""
"In the Mattermost System Console, enter the Directory (tenant) ID, "
"Application (client) ID, and Client Secret for the plugin."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 관리자 도구에서 플러그인의 Directory (tenant) ID, Application (client) ID, Client Secret을 입력합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:109
msgid ""
"Enter an **Application Display Name** to define how your application is "
"named in the MS Teams App Store.  Make it company specific for easy "
"discovery."
msgstr "**Application Display Name**\\ 을 입력하여 MS Teams App Store에서 애플리케이션의 이름이 지정되는 방식을 정의합니다. 쉽게 찾을 수 있도록 회사에 맞게 지정하세요."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:111
msgid "Save the changes and enable the plugin."
msgstr "변경 사항을 저장하고 플러그인을 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:113
msgid ""
"Select the **Download Manifest** button to generate the MS Teams "
"application as a ZIP file, containing the app manifest. Save this file as"
" it will be used in the next steps."
msgstr "**Download Manifest** 버튼을 선택하여 앱 매니페스트가 포함된 ZIP 파일로 MS Teams 애플리케이션을 생성합니다. 다음 단계에서 사용되므로 이 파일을 저장하세요."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:116
msgid "Install Mattermost in Microsoft Teams"
msgstr "Microsoft Teams에 OKR.BEST 설치"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:118
msgid ""
"Within Mattermost, the Mattermost Mission Collaboration for Microsoft "
"plugin needs to be installed and configured. This plugin acts as the "
"integration hub on the Mattermost side, connecting to both the Azure App "
"and the Teams App. The **Mattermost Plugin** is the configuration point "
"within Mattermost that unifies the integration."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 내에서 Mattermost Mission Collaboration for Microsoft 플러그인을 설치하고 구성해야 합니다. 이 플러그인은 OKR.BEST 측의 통합 허브 역할을 하며, Azure App과 Teams App 모두에 연결됩니다. **OKR.BEST 플러그인**\\ 은 통합을 하나로 묶는 OKR.BEST 내의 구성 지점입니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:120
msgid ""
"Go to the `Microsoft Teams admin center "
"<https://admin.teams.microsoft.com/dashboard>`_."
msgstr "`Microsoft Teams 관리 센터 <https://admin.teams.microsoft.com/dashboard>`_\\ 로 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:122
msgid "Go to **Teams apps > Manage apps**."
msgstr "**Teams apps > Manage apps**\\ 로 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:124
msgid ""
"In MS Teams, go to Manage Apps to install the Mattermost Mission "
"Collaboration for Microsoft 365 app."
msgstr "MS Teams에서 Manage Apps로 이동하여 Mattermost Mission Collaboration for Microsoft 365 앱을 설치합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:127
msgid ""
"Go to **Actions > Upload new app** located in the upper-right corner of "
"the Manage apps page."
msgstr "Manage apps 페이지의 오른쪽 상단에 있는 **Actions > Upload new app**\\ 으로 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:129
msgid "Select **Upload** and select the ZIP file saved previously."
msgstr "**Upload**\\ 을 선택하고 이전에 저장한 ZIP 파일을 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:131
msgid "Done! Your application is now available to users."
msgstr "완료되었습니다! 이제 애플리케이션을 사용자가 사용할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:134
msgid "Use"
msgstr "사용"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:137
msgid "Add the app"
msgstr "앱 추가"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:139
msgid ""
"Once the application is deployed, your users can add the Mattermost app "
"to their Microsoft Teams environment. Inform your users to:"
msgstr "애플리케이션이 배포되면 사용자가 Microsoft Teams 환경에 OKR.BEST 앱을 추가할 수 있습니다. 사용자에게 다음을 안내하세요:"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:141
msgid "Open Microsoft Teams and go to **Apps** in the left sidebar."
msgstr "Microsoft Teams를 열고 왼쪽 사이드바에서 **Apps**\\ 로 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:143
msgid ""
"Search for the **Application Display Name** you configured in the plugin "
"settings (step 7 of the `Configure the Mattermost plugin <#configure-the-"
"mattermost-plugin>`__ section)."
msgstr "플러그인 설정에서 구성한 **Application Display Name**\\ 을 검색합니다(`OKR.BEST 플러그인 구성 <#configure-the-mattermost-plugin>`__ 섹션의 7단계)."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:145
msgid ""
"The app will display a **Built for your org** tag, indicating it's a "
"custom application approved for your organization."
msgstr "앱에는 **Built for your org** 태그가 표시되어 조직에 승인된 사용자 정의 애플리케이션임을 나타냅니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:147
msgid ""
"Select the app and then select **Add** to install it in their Teams "
"environment."
msgstr "앱을 선택한 다음 **Add**\\ 를 선택하여 Teams 환경에 설치합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:149
msgid ""
"Once added, users can access Mattermost directly within Microsoft Teams "
"through the app tab."
msgstr "추가되면 사용자는 앱 탭을 통해 Microsoft Teams 내에서 직접 OKR.BEST에 액세스할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:154
msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "인증"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:156
msgid ""
"This plugin supports automatic authentication when logged into Microsoft "
"Teams. Teams authentication automatically logs users into Mattermost if "
"the email addresses in both platforms match exactly. Regular "
"authentication methods (LDAP, SAML, email/password, OpenID) can "
"additionally be used for Mattermost."
msgstr "이 플러그인은 Microsoft Teams에 로그인되어 있을 때 자동 인증을 지원합니다. 두 플랫폼의 이메일 주소가 정확히 일치하면 Teams 인증이 사용자를 OKR.BEST에 자동으로 로그인시킵니다. OKR.BEST에는 일반 인증 방식(LDAP, SAML, 이메일/비밀번호, OpenID)도 추가로 사용할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:158
msgid ""
"The integration automatically configures Content Security Policy (CSP) "
"and Frame Ancestors settings to ensure secure embedding of Mattermost "
"within Microsoft Teams, Outlook, and other Microsoft 365 applications. "
"Deep linking is supported, allowing users to select links in Teams "
"notifications and navigate directly to specific Mattermost posts or "
"conversations."
msgstr "이 통합은 Microsoft Teams, Outlook, 기타 Microsoft 365 애플리케이션 내에서 OKR.BEST의 안전한 임베딩을 보장하기 위해 CSP(Content Security Policy)와 Frame Ancestors 설정을 자동으로 구성합니다. 딥 링크가 지원되어 사용자가 Teams 알림의 링크를 선택하여 특정 OKR.BEST 글이나 대화로 바로 이동할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:160
msgid ""
"In air-gapped environments or during business continuity disruptions, "
"users who can't join Microsoft Teams, can continue to access Mattermost "
"using their Mattermost credentials by opening Mattermost in a separate "
"app (e.g., in a new browser window). Alternatively, a Mattermost admin "
"can pre-distribute the Mattermost desktop app using Windows MSI or the "
"mobile app via EMM."
msgstr "에어갭 환경이나 비즈니스 연속성 중단 중에 Microsoft Teams에 참여할 수 없는 사용자는 별도의 앱에서 OKR.BEST를 열어(예: 새 브라우저 창) OKR.BEST 자격 증명으로 계속 OKR.BEST에 액세스할 수 있습니다. 또는 OKR.BEST 관리자가 Windows MSI를 사용해 OKR.BEST 데스크톱 앱을 사전 배포하거나 EMM을 통해 모바일 앱을 배포할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:162
msgid "Mattermost embedded in a Microsoft Teams tab."
msgstr "Microsoft Teams 탭에 임베드된 OKR.BEST입니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:166
msgid "Activity Feed notifications"
msgstr "활동 피드 알림"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:168
msgid ""
"When you're mentioned in Mattermost while working in Microsoft Teams, "
"you'll receive notifications directly in your Teams Activity Feed. This "
"keeps you connected to important Mattermost conversations without "
"switching applications."
msgstr "Microsoft Teams에서 작업하는 동안 OKR.BEST에서 멘션되면 Teams 활동 피드에서 직접 알림을 받게 됩니다. 이를 통해 애플리케이션을 전환하지 않고도 중요한 OKR.BEST 대화에 계속 연결된 상태를 유지할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:170
msgid "**What triggers notifications:**"
msgstr "**알림을 트리거하는 항목:**"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:172
msgid "Direct mentions using @username"
msgstr "@username을 사용한 직접 멘션"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:173
msgid "Channel-wide mentions using @channel, @all, or @here"
msgstr "@channel, @all, @here를 사용한 채널 전체 멘션"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:174
msgid "Direct messages sent to you"
msgstr "사용자에게 전송된 개인 메시지"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:176
msgid "**How it works:**"
msgstr "**작동 방식:**"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:178
msgid ""
"When someone mentions you in Mattermost, a notification appears in your "
"Microsoft Teams Activity Feed. Select the notification to open Mattermost"
" and view the full context of the message. This feature uses the "
"``TeamsActivity.Send`` permission configured during the Azure app "
"registration setup."
msgstr "누군가 OKR.BEST에서 사용자를 멘션하면 Microsoft Teams 활동 피드에 알림이 표시됩니다. 알림을 선택하면 OKR.BEST가 열리고 메시지의 전체 맥락을 볼 수 있습니다. 이 기능은 Azure 앱 등록 설정 중에 구성된 ``TeamsActivity.Send`` 권한을 사용합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:180
msgid "**Disable notifications:**"
msgstr "**알림 비활성화:**"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:182
msgid ""
"System admins can disable Activity Feed notifications for specific users "
"or across your organization by configuring the "
"``disable_user_activity_notifications`` setting in the plugin "
"configuration. This setting is useful if you want to reduce notification "
"noise or if users prefer to check Mattermost manually."
msgstr "시스템 관리자는 플러그인 구성에서 ``disable_user_activity_notifications`` 설정을 구성하여 특정 사용자 또는 조직 전체에 대해 활동 피드 알림을 비활성화할 수 있습니다. 이 설정은 알림 소음을 줄이거나 사용자가 OKR.BEST를 수동으로 확인하는 것을 선호하는 경우에 유용합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:186
msgid ""
"Activity Feed notifications require the ``TeamsActivity.Send`` "
"application permission to be configured in Azure (step 6 of the `Register"
" an MS Teams app in Azure <#register-an-ms-teams-app-in-azure>`__ "
"section)."
msgstr "활동 피드 알림에는 Azure에서 ``TeamsActivity.Send`` 애플리케이션 권한이 구성되어 있어야 합니다(`Azure에서 MS Teams 앱 등록 <#register-an-ms-teams-app-in-azure>`__ 섹션의 6단계)."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:189
msgid "Get Help"
msgstr "도움말 보기"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:191
msgid ""
"Customers with a Mattermost subscription can open a `Mattermost support "
"case <https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-us/requests/new>`_."
msgstr "Mattermost 구독이 있는 고객은 `Mattermost 지원 케이스 <https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-us/requests/new>`_\\ 를 열 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:193
msgid ""
"For questions, feedback, and assistance, join our pubic `Integrations and"
" Apps channel "
"<https://community.mattermost.com/core/channels/integrations>`_ on the "
"`Mattermost Community Server <https://community.mattermost.com/>`_ for "
"assistance."
msgstr "질문, 피드백, 도움이 필요하면 `Mattermost Community Server <https://community.mattermost.com/>`_\\ 의 공개 `Integrations and Apps channel <https://community.mattermost.com/core/channels/integrations>`_\\ 에 참여하세요."

